## About CISA

CISA is the US federal agency for cybersecurity and critical infrastructure security. It publishes advisories, guidance and the Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) catalogue.

## Relevance

CISA's guidance also covers industrial control systems (ICS/OT) and is used internationally as reference material, including by European organisations.
